    apply: "Spend time in prayer confessing any known sin and receiving forgiveness, using 1 John 1:9. If you struggle with shame, tell a trusted person or counsellor. Write Romans 8:1 on a card and read it daily. Memorise Romans 8:1.",
    activity: "Read Psalm 32 and Romans 8:1-4. Practise a silent time of confession and receiving forgiveness. Then discuss how to extend grace to others. Pray together.",
    takeHome: "Read Psalm 32 and 51, Romans 8 and 1 John 1 and 3. Write a prayer of confession and thanks for forgiveness. Memorise Romans 8:1.",
    prayer: "Thank Christ for taking our condemnation. Ask him to heal our shame and make us gracious to others.",
